## 1. Product Vision (raw)

**Vision/mission draft**
> Let humans do human work, by making it super easy to package your expertise into an AI copy while keeping you in the loop.

- **Who?** Person that has expertise
- **Goal?** Package that expertise into AI so it can be applied limitlessly
- **Blocker?** No AI interface that makes it easy and useful
- **Vision =** the above is solved, and expert can now focus on human-to-human interaction

**Open questions (row 18–19, cols B / I / J):**
- What is our vision and how do we build towards it?
- Humans that do human work?
- How do we help our customers sell outcomes instead of selling hours?
- Publish extractions
- Self-improving data on a repetitiveness level?
- Improve on org/team/extraction level?

